*> Names that a communication description (CD) declares in its
*> clauses, and the fields of the DEBUG-ITEM special register.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COMMS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. ANY-COMPUTER WITH DEBUGGING MODE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-QUEUE        PIC X(12) VALUE "ORDERS".
COMMUNICATION SECTION.
CD  IN-QUEUE FOR INPUT
    SYMBOLIC QUEUE IS MAIN-QUEUE
    MESSAGE COUNT IS MSG-COUNT
    TEXT LENGTH IS MSG-LENGTH
    STATUS KEY IS IN-STATUS.
CD  OUT-QUEUE FOR OUTPUT
    DESTINATION COUNT IS DEST-COUNT
    STATUS KEY IS OUT-STATUS.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DECLARATIVES.
TRACE-SECTION SECTION.
    USE FOR DEBUGGING ON ALL PROCEDURES.
TRACE-PARA.
    DISPLAY DEBUG-NAME DEBUG-LINE DEBUG-CONTENTS.
END DECLARATIVES.
MAIN SECTION.
MAIN-LINE.
    MOVE WS-QUEUE TO MAIN-QUEUE
    ACCEPT MSG-COUNT FROM IN-QUEUE COUNT
    IF IN-STATUS = "00" AND OUT-STATUS = "00"
        MOVE 1 TO DEST-COUNT
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
